/**
 * demoSeed.js — offline catalog
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * A 1:1 mirror of sql/seed.sql so the app is fully explorable with no Supabase
 * project, no network and no env vars. Shapes match the `track_details` view
 * exactly, meaning views never branch on which provider is active.
 *
 * Audio + artwork are local files under /assets, generated by tools/*.py.
 * The two TikTok rows use REAL video ids from @spotibai_ph with their live
 * captions/hashtags so the video panel renders authentic content structure.
 */

